;  772
;  773    ! DERIVATIVE: RESULT is the derivative of the expression at X, by Ridders'
;  774    ! method (C. J. F. Ridders, 1982, as "Numerical Recipes" gives it).
;  775    !
;  776    ! The central difference (f(x + h) - f(x - h)) / 2h is wrong by a series
;  777    ! in even powers of h, c1 h^2 + c2 h^4 + ...; a smaller h makes it more
